    <node id="NSU">
      <data key="d0">NSU</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Novosibirsk State University, abbreviated as NSU, offers various educational programs through its departments.&lt;SEP&gt;NSU stands for Novosibirsk State University.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University combines natural science, engineering, and humanities competencies.</data>
